ource_number":"六十","source_term":"年六十餘","bounds":{"lower":60,"lower_inclusive":false,"upper":null,"upper_inclusive":null},"group_reference":{"source_term":"趙相貫髙、趙午等","naming_term":"貫髙、趙午","person_ids":["2t1_1bj_ewv","r42_dd9_xyv"],"additional_members_unknown":true},"unit":"source_age_years","counting":"unspecified_source_age","birth_year":null,"status":"source_attested","date_expression":"漢七年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p024","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0046","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/089.json"}],"interpretation_note":"具名兩人的群體報齡，等字仍有未名成員，名單不是全體。六十餘只支持大於六十，沒有六十九上限；非死亡年齡，不定計歲法、不反推出生年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":200,"year":-199,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"漢七年，髙祖從平城過趙，趙王朝夕袒韛蔽，自上食，禮甚卑，有子婿禮。髙祖箕踞詈，甚慢易之。趙相貫髙、趙午等年六十餘，故張耳客也。生平爲氣，乃怒曰：「吾王孱王也！」説王曰：「夫天下豪桀并起，能者先立。今王事髙祖甚恭，而髙祖無禮，請爲王殺之！」張敖齧其指出血，曰：「君何言之誤！且先人亡國，賴髙祖得復國，德流子孫，秋豪皆髙祖力也。願君無復出口。」貫髙、趙午等十餘人皆相謂曰：「乃吾等非也。吾王長者，不倍德。且吾等義不辱，今怨髙祖辱我王，故欲殺之，何乃汙王爲乎？令事成歸王，事敗獨身坐耳。」","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p024","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0046","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/089.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記·漢興以來諸侯王年表》原紀年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷017&oldid=2607010","quote":"七","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r007-c01","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來諸侯王年表》數位年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷017&oldid=2607010","quote":"200","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r007-c00","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"按本段明示漢七年，參照固定數位年表對照前200年；只給報齡事件年，不是生年、卒年或持職始年，未核書影。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}],"mentions":[{